[en.FOCUS_C08_CRYSTAL_AND_SNOW]
Land of Crystal and Snow

[en.FOCUS_C08_CRYSTAL_AND_SNOW_desc]
Princess Cadance... How is she now?

After the Ultimate Battle and “Jahr Null”, three of Equestria's four alicorn princesses were missing, while Princess Cadance remained under house arrest in the Crystal Empire, her present condition equally difficult to confirm. Flurry Heart is the leader of the Crystal Empire now, so Cadance should be fine, right?

The National Security Department will assess the situation based on the current status of the Crystal Empire, and try to acquire more information about the actual situation of the Crystal Empire, and more importantly, the current situation of Princess Cadance. After all, protecting the princesses of Equestria is our duty...

[en.FOCUS_C08_CRYSTAL_AND_SNOW_TOOLTIP]
Allow intervention in the §YCrystal Empire Council§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_CRYSTAL_AND_SNOW]
水晶与风雪之地

[zh.FOCUS_C08_CRYSTAL_AND_SNOW_desc]
音韵公主... 她现在怎么样了呢？

自终末之战和“新元年”后，小马利亚的四位天角兽公主中，三位下落不明，音韵公主则被软禁在水晶帝国，现况同样难以确认。风雪之心现在说是水晶帝国的领导者，所以音韵应该也不会有事吧？

国家安全部会根据水晶帝国的现状作状况评估，并通过一些渠道了解水晶帝国的实际情况，更重要的是了解音韵公主的现况。毕竟，保护小马利亚的公主是我们的义务...

[zh.FOCUS_C08_CRYSTAL_AND_SNOW_TOOLTIP]
允许干涉§Y水晶帝国理事会§!

